    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cause and consequence",
     "texto": [
      "**Z powodu** («because of») and **mimo** («despite») are followed by the genitive: **z powodu deszczu**, **mimo zmęczenia**.",
      "**Dzięki** («thanks to») also usually takes the dative. These expressions help avoid a long subordinate clause."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
